{
  "title": "Yee FDTD",
  "html": "<h1>Yee FDTD</h1><p>Yee FDTDはMaxwellの回転方程式を空間・時間にずらした格子で更新します。電場と磁場を同じ位置・時刻に置く単純な中心差分とは異なる構成です。</p><h2 id=\"model\">対象と代表式</h2><p>線形・等方・非分散で、一定の誘電率εと透磁率μを持つ領域では波速c=1/√(εμ)です。電場Eは整数時刻、磁束密度Bは半整数時刻で表し、H=B/μとします。下式のcurlₕは、変数配置と整合する離散回転演算子です。</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">curl</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">curl</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>h</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">J</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf B^{n+1/2}&amp;=\\mathbf B^{n-1/2}-\\Delta t\\,\\operatorname{curl}_h\\mathbf E^n,\\\\\\mathbf E^{n+1}&amp;=\\mathbf E^n+\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\epsilon}\\left(\\operatorname{curl}_h\\mathbf H^{n+1/2}-\\mathbf J^{n+1/2}\\right).\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:3.6443em;vertical-align:-1.5722em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0722em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.4945em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4742em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5722em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0722em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.4945em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">curl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4742em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">curl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5722em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"algorithm\">計算の流れ</h2><p>面を囲む電場の循環から磁場を半ステップずらして更新し、磁場の循環と電流から次の電場を求めます。初期場と境界条件もこの時刻配置で与えます。構造的なdivₕ curlₕ=0は離散磁束制約に有用ですが、電荷保存には電流との整合も必要です。</p><h2 id=\"conditions\">適用条件と落とし穴</h2><p>一様直交格子・一定媒質の標準方式では cΔt√(Δx⁻²+Δy⁻²+Δz⁻²)≤1 が安定条件です。分散媒質、吸収境界、導電項を加えると個別に検討します。安定でも数値分散・階段状境界誤差は残り、PMLの設定だけで反射がゼロになるとは限りません。</p><h2 id=\"verification\">検証するときに見る量</h2><p>周期平面波の位相速度と格子収束、完全導体箱の固有周波数、媒質界面の反射・透過を解析解と比較します。エネルギーの収支、磁場発散、Gauss則の残差は別々に測ります。MHDのCT法との類似はありますが、同じ方程式ではありません。</p><h2 id=\"publication-scope\">公開範囲と関連項目</h2><p>解説・代表式・文献を公開しています。専用コードと数値検証結果は実装予定です。上記の検証案は未実施で、他の手法のコードや計算結果をこの手法の検証として流用しません。</p><ul><li><a href=\"/numerical-methods-atlas/methods/fdtd/?lang=ja\">Yee FDTD</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sources\">一次文献・関連資料と確認範囲</h2><p>原著、後続の変種、著者による著書、概説、公式資料を区別して参照します。DOI・書誌の確認と原文の該当箇所の閲覧を区別し、論文全体の監査や数値再現を行ったという意味ではありません。確認範囲の注記は引用ごとに示します。</p><ol class=\"reading-sources\"><li id=\"source-yee1966\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/tap.1966.1138693\">Kane Yee (1966). Numerical solution of initial boundary value problems involving maxwell&#x27;s equations in isotropic media</a>. IEEE Transactions on Antennas and Propagation<p>研究論文・提案または関連する定式化 · 書誌確認 · <a href=\"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1109%2FTAP.1966.1138693\">確認した資料</a></p><p>DOI登録等で著者・題名・刊行年と書誌的な同一性を確認。原文全体の監査や数値再現は未実施です。</p></li></ol>",
